{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026twEwlEiwUb1794380884.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產大埔昌運中心高級資深分區營業經理招權峰表示，近期入市氣氛正面，大埔中心最新錄14座高層B室，單位實用面積391平方呎，2房間隔，日前議價後以488萬元沽出，平均實用呎價約12,481元。<br/>據了解，新買家為海外回流退休人士，見單位位置方便，價錢合理，即決定「Full Pay」購入單位自用。據了解，原業主於1987年以32.6萬元一手購入上址，持貨約39年，現轉手賬面獲利455.4萬元離場，單位期內升值近14倍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:24:06.961115+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T09:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T14:15:58.621419+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T10:17:28.643414+00:00","content_hash":"7e42628d000a61b53e764eacb1503d92cff377956ad4ea81b4b41356ad5ae599","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:24:06.961115+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}